    "Kostenlose Accounts bekommen nur wenige neue App-IDs pro Woche. Jede App und jede ihrer Erweiterungen braucht eine. Den genauen Stand meldet Apple hier.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free accounts get only a few new app IDs per week. Every app and each of its extensions needs one. Apple reports the exact count here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les comptes gratuits n'obtiennent que quelques identifiants d'app par semaine. Chaque app et chacune de ses extensions en nécessite un. Apple indique ici le nombre exact."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las cuentas gratuitas solo reciben unas pocas ID de app nuevas por semana. Cada app y cada una de sus extensiones necesita una. Apple indica aquí la cifra exacta."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli account gratuiti ricevono solo pochi nuovi ID app a settimana. Ogni app e ogni sua estensione ne richiede uno. Apple indica qui il numero esatto."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ücretsiz hesaplar haftada yalnızca birkaç yeni uygulama kimliği alır. Her uygulama ve her uzantısı bir tane gerektirir. Kesin durumu Apple burada bildirir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kryptografie für zsign. Apache-Lizenz 2.0. Swift-Paket: krzyzanowskim/OpenSSL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
